        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298130/extras/6373156dc2e06e274c06e8a5e9df7581.poster.avif?t=1764964378\" width=500 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298130/extras/6373156dc2e06e274c06e8a5e9df7581.webm?t=1764964378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298130/extras/6373156dc2e06e274c06e8a5e9df7581.mp4?t=1764964378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mazewar</strong> is a remake inspired by the first-ever multiplayer first-person shooter, dating back to 1973. Modernized and subtly enhanced with new mechanics, this recreation keeps the original spirit alive and pulls this forgotten shooter into the present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse through mazes, battling enemy eyes, compete against friends on servers in this grid-based, vector-graphics shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New features that set this version apart from the classic include:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to dodge enemy fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Themes to customize your visual experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive, fast-paced, and strategic gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Quick Join:</strong><br>Automatically searches for an active online match and connects you instantly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Start Online Match:</strong><br>Creates a new online match that any player can join. You can also invite friends directly through the Steam chat or your friends list.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Start Offline Match:</strong><br>Starts an offline session designed exclusively for playing against bots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Play Note:</strong><br>Mazewar uses <strong>P2P networking</strong>, so latency will depend on the distance between players and the quality of their connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W - SPACE              -&gt; Missile launcher</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S                             -&gt; Laser</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A - D                       -&gt; Dodge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow keys             -&gt; Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TAB                        -&gt; Players List</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamepad:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Square/X                 -&gt; Missile launcher</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >R1/RB                     -&gt; Laser</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LT/L2 - RT/R2         -&gt; Dodge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Right D-pad    -&gt; Rotate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X/A - Up                 -&gt; Move Forwards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circle/B  - Down    -&gt; Move Backwards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SELECT                  -&gt; Players List</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: </strong>The project is still in much needed development, but you can already dive in and get a glimpse of this piece of gaming history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298130/extras/6373156dc2e06e274c06e8a5e9df7581.poster.avif?t=1764964378\" width=500 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298130/extras/6373156dc2e06e274c06e8a5e9df7581.webm?t=1764964378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298130/extras/6373156dc2e06e274c06e8a5e9df7581.mp4?t=1764964378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mazewar</strong> is a remake inspired by the first-ever multiplayer first-person shooter, dating back to 1973. Modernized and subtly enhanced with new mechanics, this recreation keeps the original spirit alive and pulls this forgotten shooter into the present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse through mazes, battling enemy eyes, compete against friends on servers in this grid-based, vector-graphics shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New features that set this version apart from the classic include:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to dodge enemy fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Themes to customize your visual experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive, fast-paced, and strategic gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Quick Join:</strong><br>Automatically searches for an active online match and connects you instantly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Start Online Match:</strong><br>Creates a new online match that any player can join. You can also invite friends directly through the Steam chat or your friends list.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>• Start Offline Match:</strong><br>Starts an offline session designed exclusively for playing against bots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Play Note:</strong><br>Mazewar uses <strong>P2P networking</strong>, so latency will depend on the distance between players and the quality of their connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W - SPACE              -&gt; Missile launcher</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S                             -&gt; Laser</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A - D                       -&gt; Dodge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow keys             -&gt; Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TAB                        -&gt; Players List</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamepad:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Square/X                 -&gt; Missile launcher</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >R1/RB                     -&gt; Laser</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LT/L2 - RT/R2         -&gt; Dodge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Right D-pad    -&gt; Rotate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X/A - Up                 -&gt; Move Forwards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circle/B  - Down    -&gt; Move Backwards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SELECT                  -&gt; Players List</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: </strong>The project is still in much needed development, but you can already dive in and get a glimpse of this piece of gaming history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
